+/* Harness: the card asleep as the vendor's suspend leaves it: cache
+ * flushed, deselected, CMD5 sleep, SD clock stopped, SDCC1 clocks off.
+ * Waking only re-enables the branch clocks: the rate set_clock chose
+ * stays programmed. Any transfer wakes it; a failed wake stops transfers. */
+static bool card_asleep;
